              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 1,
                  "text": "Titanium Industries | Metal Supplier for Consumer Products"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "As a leading Metal Supplier for Consumer Products, T.I. has been delivering best value specialty metals and titanium products to the global market since 1972. With an extensive inventory of specialty metals and titanium mill products, we offer a diverse range of grades and sizes, ensuring quick lead times to meet your manufacturing requirements. Discover below how T.I. continues to be a trusted partner for consumer applications, providing top-quality metal solutions that fuel innovation and excellence in various industries."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "column-13",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "text-15",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "text": "[General Line Card | Download Now](https://titanium.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/General-Line-Card-Titanium-Industries.pdf)"
                }
